WEBVTT

00:03.169 --> 00:05.505
- [boy 1] Four. Four.
- [boys exclaiming]

00:05.588 --> 00:07.465
- [boy 2] I got nothing right.
- [boy 1] Two.

00:07.549 --> 00:09.217
- [boy 3] Yes!
- [boy 1] Five.

00:09.300 --> 00:10.385
KOREAN
CORRECT ANSWERS

00:10.468 --> 00:13.346
- [boy 1] Five. Three.
- [boy 4] I only got one right. All right!

00:13.430 --> 00:15.015
- [boy 5] You're going fast.
- [boy 1] Four.

00:15.098 --> 00:17.726
- [groans] Oh my god!
- [boy 4] Dude, I didn't get four.

00:17.809 --> 00:20.603
- I keep getting everything wrong!
- [boy 1] Two. Three.

00:21.271 --> 00:22.897
- Three.
- [murmured conversation]

00:22.981 --> 00:24.524
- [boy 1] One.
- [boy 5] I can't hear it.

00:25.025 --> 00:26.443
[silence]

00:27.193 --> 00:28.570
[boy 5] Whoa. Who did that?

00:29.070 --> 00:30.280
[tense music playing]

00:30.363 --> 00:31.656
[boy 5] What happened?

00:31.740 --> 00:32.949
[boy 2] What's goin' on?

00:33.616 --> 00:35.201
[boys continue whispered conversations]

00:35.285 --> 00:37.078
- Is he okay?
- He seems pissed.

00:37.162 --> 00:39.080
- Yeah, I see that.
- Yeah, super pissed.

00:39.164 --> 00:41.374
- See that?
- What's going on?

00:41.458 --> 00:42.584
- What?
- Man…

00:42.667 --> 00:43.793
Quiet…

00:44.878 --> 00:46.004
What's his problem?

00:46.087 --> 00:47.213
[creaking]

00:51.342 --> 00:53.053
Stay calm. Dude, just…

00:54.262 --> 00:55.764
[silence]

01:01.102 --> 01:03.104
["Hero" by Meego playing]

01:16.826 --> 01:21.831
WEAK HERO:
CLASS 1

02:14.968 --> 02:17.470
CLASS OF 2022 UNIVERSITY ADMISSIONS
SEOUL NATIONAL UNIVERSITY: 3

02:17.554 --> 02:18.888
[gentle, uplifting music playing]

02:18.972 --> 02:21.141
YONSEI UNIVERSITY: 7
SOGANG UNIVERSITY: 5

02:21.766 --> 02:27.272
"THE BIRD FIGHTS ITS WAY OUT OF THE EGG"

02:27.355 --> 02:29.524
DEMIAN BY HERMANN HESSE

02:30.733 --> 02:34.195
13 DAYS EARLIER

02:34.279 --> 02:35.488
[scribbling]

02:35.572 --> 02:36.698
[boy] Quadratic formula.

02:36.781 --> 02:40.368
Arrange the unknowns and the constant term
on the left side in descending order,

02:40.451 --> 02:42.078
place zero on the right side,

02:42.162 --> 02:45.206
resulting in ax squared
plus by squared plus c equals zero.

02:46.875 --> 02:48.084
[teacher] Hey, Si-eun.

02:48.751 --> 02:49.878
Nice work there.

02:51.087 --> 02:52.839
ENGLISH - CH. 8
MATH - 2021 MOCK TEST

02:52.922 --> 02:54.132
[Si-eun] Imo Mutiny.

02:54.215 --> 02:58.678
An uprising in 1882, in the 19th year
of King Gojeong's Joseon Dynasty reign.

02:58.761 --> 03:01.347
Soldiers of the old army rebelled
against military reforms,

03:01.431 --> 03:04.934
unpaid wages and discrimination
compared to the modern Pyolgigun unit.

03:05.018 --> 03:07.770
This triggered Heungseon Daewongun
to seize power again.

03:08.855 --> 03:10.273
[scribbling]

03:10.356 --> 03:11.441
[Si-eun] Active voice.

03:11.524 --> 03:13.318
The object of the active voice becomes

03:13.401 --> 03:15.486
the subject of the passive voice
in pattern four.

03:15.570 --> 03:17.322
A pattern four sentence has two objects,

03:17.405 --> 03:19.490
so it can be written
as two passive sentences

03:19.574 --> 03:20.867
with each object as a subject.

03:20.950 --> 03:22.535
MOCK TEST IN 13 DAYS

03:22.619 --> 03:24.621
[gentle, uplifting music continues]

03:44.349 --> 03:46.476
[boy 1] Okay!
All right, that's fine. So, uh…

03:46.559 --> 03:48.561
- No, seriously?
- [boys chatting]

03:49.395 --> 03:53.858
Everyone, two of you received an award
in the Intramural Mathematics Competition.

03:55.652 --> 03:58.404
Yeon Si-eun, Jeon Yeong-bin. Come up here.

03:58.488 --> 04:00.490
- [all] Ooh!
- All right!

04:05.161 --> 04:06.120
[boy 2] Congrats.

04:06.621 --> 04:08.623
[teacher] "Yeon Si-eun, gold prize."

04:08.706 --> 04:13.294
"This student won the above prize at the
2022 Intramural Mathematics Competition

04:13.378 --> 04:15.421
and is hereby awarded this certificate."

04:16.089 --> 04:17.298
Nice work, Si-eun.

04:22.637 --> 04:24.722
"Jeon Yeong-bin, bronze prize."

04:24.806 --> 04:27.684
- I'm handing you the same certificate.
- Give it up!

04:27.767 --> 04:29.644
- [cheering]
- Thank you! High five!

04:33.648 --> 04:36.901
[teacher] We are now less
than two weeks away from the mock test.

04:37.568 --> 04:39.696
Have you all been preparing for it?

04:40.196 --> 04:41.823
[all chorus] Yes.

04:43.616 --> 04:46.035
Take this mock test seriously
so you're prepared

04:46.119 --> 04:48.371
when taking
the real college entrance exam.

04:49.455 --> 04:51.291
- [pop music playing]
- [boy 1] With more passion.

04:51.374 --> 04:53.293
- That's it! [laughs]
- [boy 2] Shake it. Shake it.

04:53.376 --> 04:55.253
- Yeah, like that.
- [clattering]

04:55.336 --> 04:56.546
[boy 2] Twirl more.

04:56.629 --> 04:57.588
[boy 1 laughs]

04:57.672 --> 04:59.966
[boy 2] It's okay,
but shake your ass some more.

05:00.591 --> 05:03.720
- Aah! [laughing]
- Yeah. Good. Ooh, shake it. You're sexy!

05:03.803 --> 05:05.930
- [boy 1] Shake your body.
- Oh shit…

05:06.764 --> 05:09.559
Agh! No. You're supposed
to turn around, dumbass.

05:09.642 --> 05:10.643
[music stops]

05:10.727 --> 05:12.270
[boy 2] Fucked it up again.

05:12.937 --> 05:15.815
Hey, you know that people
freaking love your videos, right?

05:16.691 --> 05:19.277
You'll be a celebrity in no time
if you keep it up.

05:19.777 --> 05:20.945
Listen to me.

05:21.029 --> 05:23.114
Your family's poor as shit,
no connections,

05:23.197 --> 05:24.699
and you don't fucking study.

05:26.117 --> 05:28.077
This is the only way you'll survive.

05:29.871 --> 05:30.997
Aren't you grateful?

05:33.082 --> 05:36.085
- Thanks… a lot.
- [boy 3] …rather see me play video games…

05:36.961 --> 05:39.130
If you're grateful, get me a Gatorade.

05:39.213 --> 05:41.758
- [boy 2] Oh, I want Milkis.
- [boy 1] Gimme a Coke Zero.

05:41.841 --> 05:43.509
- Okay.
- [all laugh]

05:44.093 --> 05:45.803
I don't think he suffered enough.

05:46.846 --> 05:48.848
[boy 1] He needs his ass kicked some more.

05:51.517 --> 05:53.686
[boy 4] Exactly.
You gonna have your notes done?

05:53.770 --> 05:55.438
- Hey.
- [boy 1 laughs]

05:56.356 --> 05:57.273
Give me that.

06:00.026 --> 06:02.403
- [boy 2] What are you gonna do?
- [boy 1] What?

06:03.696 --> 06:05.323
- Ooh.
- [boy 2] Whoa.

06:09.035 --> 06:12.538
[Yeong-bin chuckles] You should've
aimed better, asshole. He got hit.

06:13.247 --> 06:16.376
- Yeah, he's right. Why'd you--
- Ay!

06:16.918 --> 06:19.420
Yo, I'm sorry about that. Go study.

06:21.047 --> 06:22.090
I'm sorry.

06:24.967 --> 06:26.302
Next time, be careful.

06:27.553 --> 06:31.015
- [all] Oh…
- [boy 2] Oh-ho!

06:31.099 --> 06:33.476
He's so in for it now, man.

06:33.559 --> 06:34.727
[laughs]

06:34.811 --> 06:36.562
[tense music playing]

06:36.646 --> 06:38.147
[Yeong-bin] It was a mistake.

06:40.233 --> 06:42.068
I said it was a mistake.

06:43.945 --> 06:46.155
- Are you rubbing my face in it?
- Be careful…

06:47.824 --> 06:49.450
not to make more mistakes.

06:51.786 --> 06:54.205
[sighs] Shit, man.

07:02.088 --> 07:02.964
Hey.

07:04.382 --> 07:05.425
You know what?

07:06.884 --> 07:09.011
Everyone thinks you're full of yourself.

07:11.139 --> 07:14.559
No matter what you say,
you make it sound irritating.

07:17.186 --> 07:18.271
Don't you think?

07:21.441 --> 07:22.733
You must be bored.

07:23.818 --> 07:24.652
What?

07:25.236 --> 07:28.489
You should go expand your vocabulary.

07:28.990 --> 07:30.158
[writing]

07:30.241 --> 07:31.576
Wanna die?

07:34.495 --> 07:35.621
[drops pen]

07:38.458 --> 07:40.710
BYUKSAN HIGH SCHOOL

07:40.793 --> 07:41.669
[scoffs]

07:42.628 --> 07:44.672
[player 1] Which one of you is Ahn Su-ho?

07:47.967 --> 07:49.760
Su-ho-ya. Ahn Su-ho.

07:49.844 --> 07:51.304
- Hmm?
- Ahn Su-ho!

07:54.015 --> 07:56.517
[Su-ho] What's up? It's lunchtime already?

07:58.186 --> 07:59.479
[player 1] Was it you?

08:00.229 --> 08:01.147
Did you…

08:01.898 --> 08:04.692
- [sniffles] Did you hit on Na-eun?
- [Su-ho] Na-eun?

08:06.486 --> 08:07.361
Lee Na-eun?

08:09.071 --> 08:10.490
Park Na-eun. Park Na-eun?

08:10.573 --> 08:12.450
Son Na-eun, you fucking shithead!

08:12.533 --> 08:15.495
Oh. She kept DMing me,
but she's not my type.

08:15.578 --> 08:18.456
We went to eat, like, one time,
but I'm not into her.

08:18.539 --> 08:19.916
- Hey, what's for lunch today?
- This…

08:19.999 --> 08:22.460
- J… jaeyuk.
- Sounds good.

08:22.543 --> 08:23.878
Protein is good.

08:23.961 --> 08:25.213
I'm hungry.

08:25.296 --> 08:26.130
Hey!

08:26.214 --> 08:28.257
[upbeat music playing]

08:28.341 --> 08:29.342
Uh, stay back.

08:29.425 --> 08:31.219
[students gasping and exclaiming]

08:32.428 --> 08:33.513
Hey!

08:34.555 --> 08:36.224
[players yelling]

08:39.852 --> 08:41.229
[students gasping]

08:41.312 --> 08:43.356
- [player 2 yelps]
- Yah!

08:44.857 --> 08:46.359
- You got scared.
- [player 3] Hey!

08:46.442 --> 08:48.110
[grunting]

08:48.194 --> 08:49.195
Ah…

08:50.279 --> 08:51.489
Oh shit…

08:51.572 --> 08:52.698
Asshole!

08:54.033 --> 08:55.868
- [wails]
- [bats clatter to floor]

08:56.661 --> 08:58.412
Hey, hey. Hey, come here.

08:59.080 --> 08:59.956
Hey.

09:00.581 --> 09:01.499
You want more?

09:03.543 --> 09:04.585
Asshole!

09:04.669 --> 09:05.711
Whoa!

09:05.795 --> 09:07.838
[player 1] Ow, ow, ow!

09:07.922 --> 09:09.507
- [Su-ho] Hey, hey, hey.
- Ow! Let go of me.

09:09.590 --> 09:11.342
[Su-ho] Should you be doing this,
as athletes?

09:11.425 --> 09:12.468
[player 1] Damn it!

09:12.552 --> 09:13.761
[screams]

09:13.844 --> 09:15.471
[groans] Okay!

09:15.555 --> 09:16.722
Fine! Fuck!

09:17.515 --> 09:18.558
That hurt!

09:21.727 --> 09:23.312
Son of a bitch. Hey, shithead!

09:23.396 --> 09:24.313
[students gasp]

09:24.397 --> 09:25.898
[all] Whoa!

09:28.317 --> 09:30.570
- [all] Whoa!
- [clattering]

09:31.237 --> 09:32.905
[sighs] You went too far.

09:34.699 --> 09:35.908
You fucking shithead!

09:36.742 --> 09:38.494
- [gurgles]
- [thud]

09:38.578 --> 09:40.329
[boy 4] Oh. How is he?

09:40.413 --> 09:41.789
- [Su-ho sighs]
- [boy 5] He's okay.

09:41.872 --> 09:43.499
Hey, take him to the nurse.

09:43.583 --> 09:45.418
I'll kill you if you tell 'em
hyeong did it.

09:45.501 --> 09:47.211
- Hmm?
- [player 1 sighs] Shit.

09:49.463 --> 09:51.424
- [murmuring]
- [boy 5] Well, that was a mess.

09:52.341 --> 09:55.428
- Come on, let's take him to the nurse.
- [boy 4] Yeah, let's go.

09:55.511 --> 09:56.596
Help me help him up.

09:59.974 --> 10:01.058
[boy 6] Wanted them to…

10:01.142 --> 10:02.935
Oh, uh, was that my fault?

10:03.019 --> 10:05.688
- [boy 6] Want to see him take 'em all on.
- Yeah.

10:07.231 --> 10:08.232
[Su-ho] Oh.

10:08.316 --> 10:09.775
[pens and pencils clattering]

10:09.859 --> 10:11.861
Sorry, man. It's my bad, okay?

10:13.237 --> 10:14.113
Hmm.

10:14.196 --> 10:15.573
Fight outside.

10:16.449 --> 10:17.992
[boy 4] Yeah, a proper fight.

10:21.370 --> 10:22.955
Think it might be cool.

10:23.914 --> 10:25.750
NATIONAL EXCELLENCE AWARD IN MATHEMATICS

10:25.833 --> 10:28.794
[man] Massages are great,
but that's not all the team needs.

10:28.878 --> 10:31.088
You need to eat better to gain strength.

10:31.172 --> 10:32.798
- Exactly.
- [door keypad bleeping]

10:32.882 --> 10:36.344
If I catch you trying to sneak out
like last time, it'll be the end of you.

10:36.427 --> 10:37.470
- [door slams]
- Okay?

10:38.596 --> 10:40.890
- All right. Yeah, I'll see you later.
- [lock bleeps]

10:41.432 --> 10:42.892
Hey, kiddo. You're home.

10:45.102 --> 10:47.813
I'm heading out
for another off-season training camp.

10:47.897 --> 10:50.900
I'll be gone a couple of weeks.
Call me if you need to.

10:50.983 --> 10:51.901
Okay.

10:54.070 --> 10:55.404
Your teacher called today.

10:55.905 --> 10:57.615
She said you won first place.

11:10.169 --> 11:12.630
"Yeon Si-eun, gold prize."

11:12.713 --> 11:13.714
[chuckles]

11:15.883 --> 11:19.095
Si-eun-a, you know that this…
this is the reason I exist, right?

11:20.346 --> 11:21.806
I'm really proud of you.

11:25.810 --> 11:26.727
Okay.

11:27.436 --> 11:28.938
[phone buzzing]

11:31.691 --> 11:32.817
[father] Yeah? What?

11:33.484 --> 11:36.195
I already did that. I let them all know.

11:39.031 --> 11:41.492
[woman on video] That should make it
easier to understand.

11:41.575 --> 11:42.952
We can move on now, right?

11:43.035 --> 11:46.247
The number of intersection points
can be determined

11:46.330 --> 11:48.499
by drawing each graph
and identifying where they cross.

11:48.582 --> 11:49.834
[knock at door]

11:50.543 --> 11:52.586
[woman] As you can see
by this example…

11:53.671 --> 11:54.839
[stops video]

11:56.257 --> 11:57.842
[father] You two stay in touch?

11:59.343 --> 12:00.886
I'm just studying right now.

12:03.556 --> 12:04.807
I'm heading out.

12:05.474 --> 12:07.184
- [Si-eun] Have a good time.
- [father] Bye.

12:13.607 --> 12:14.692
[lock bleeps]

12:15.359 --> 12:16.485
[door slams]

12:17.778 --> 12:18.904
[lock bleeps]

12:19.655 --> 12:20.948
Is all that clear?

12:21.907 --> 12:23.951
[sighs] I want you all to know

12:24.034 --> 12:26.328
that my son is number one at his school.

12:26.996 --> 12:30.833
Okay? But I never force him to study.

12:30.916 --> 12:33.419
Why? He's self-motivated.

12:33.502 --> 12:36.714
As I always like to say,
when it comes to your studies…

12:36.797 --> 12:39.216
BYUKSAN HIGH SCHOOL

12:39.300 --> 12:40.801
[birdsong]

12:43.345 --> 12:44.889
[snoring]

12:56.817 --> 12:58.194
[lights buzzing]

12:58.277 --> 12:59.987
[Su-ho] Damn it. [sighs]

13:02.656 --> 13:03.783
[groans]

13:14.293 --> 13:16.295
[tense music playing]

13:21.467 --> 13:22.760
[laughter]

13:22.843 --> 13:25.554
- Oh! Ooh. Holy shit, she's hot.
- [bully 1] Let me see.

13:25.638 --> 13:27.264
- [Yeong-bin] Turn your phone round.
- Whoa!

13:27.348 --> 13:29.475
- [Yeong-bin] Show me your phone.
- [bully 2] Look at her.

13:29.558 --> 13:31.519
- So my type.
- [bully 1] Why set her up with him?

13:31.602 --> 13:34.355
- [bully 2] Why the hell do you think?
- [bully 1] Look in a mirror, bruh.

13:34.438 --> 13:37.066
- Look at your baby muscles, bro.
- [bully 1] You mean these guns?

13:37.149 --> 13:38.442
[bully 2] Nah, your rizz is shit.

13:38.526 --> 13:41.862
- [bully 1] Should I just give up and die?
- [Yeong-bin] Hey, I'll set you up too.

13:42.905 --> 13:44.323
[bully 1] Stop messing with me, man.

13:44.406 --> 13:47.535
[bully 1] I'll give her to you…
if you beat me in arm wrestling.

13:48.285 --> 13:50.621
- Think you can handle it?
- [bully 1] Ask him.

13:52.957 --> 13:54.625
[bully 2] Who do you think will win?

13:55.584 --> 13:57.837
- [bully 1] Answer him.
- [Yeong-bin] Why are you staring?

13:58.546 --> 14:00.673
What? You need something?

14:02.049 --> 14:04.760
- Yo, I could snap you like a twig.
- [hisses]

14:04.844 --> 14:05.803
[bully 2 tuts]

14:05.886 --> 14:07.513
- [chair scrapes]
- [bully 1] Let's go.

14:08.597 --> 14:10.891
- Look at how big my muscles are.
- That's not a muscle.

14:10.975 --> 14:13.978
- You think it's a ball sack or somethin'?
- [bully 2] Yo, bro!

14:14.061 --> 14:16.772
[chuckling] Why would you
call it a ball sack? You weirdo.

14:18.691 --> 14:19.692
[tense music continues]

14:19.775 --> 14:22.111
- [boys panting and groaning]
- [boy 1] Oh God, my legs.

14:22.903 --> 14:24.572
[panting]

14:27.157 --> 14:28.826
[boy 2] Let's go! Hey. Keep it up.

14:28.909 --> 14:30.744
Keep it up! Keep it up! Hey!

14:30.828 --> 14:32.037
Hey! Let's go!

14:32.621 --> 14:34.164
[upbeat music playing]

14:35.124 --> 14:36.000
Yeah!

14:37.126 --> 14:38.127
Whoo!

14:38.210 --> 14:39.503
- [bleep]
- Six minutes 12 seconds.

14:39.587 --> 14:41.839
Hey, can you…
can you take off five seconds?

14:41.922 --> 14:45.009
[coach] Su-ho-ya,
consider applying to sports colleges.

14:45.092 --> 14:46.468
You'd make the cut.

14:46.552 --> 14:48.888
I'm not planning to compete
in the Olympics.

14:48.971 --> 14:51.432
I'll think about it once I beat
my bro Bolt's record, okay?

14:52.016 --> 14:53.392
Your bro Bolt? Who's that?

14:53.976 --> 14:55.519
[panting] You don't know Bolt?

14:56.228 --> 14:57.187
Usain Bolt.

14:58.105 --> 15:00.357
- Nice work.
- This kid. [chuckles]

15:02.318 --> 15:03.569
[bleep]

15:03.652 --> 15:05.613
- 6.45.
- How many?

15:05.696 --> 15:07.239
[boy 3] Come on. Come on. Come on.

15:07.323 --> 15:08.490
[boy 4] Yes, I'm tired.

15:09.116 --> 15:10.784
[boy 3] You can get water at the fence.

15:10.868 --> 15:11.994
- [sighs]
- [boy 5] Yeah.

15:12.077 --> 15:14.455
- That's the best one.
- [boy 4] You're not? Oh my God, my legs.

15:14.538 --> 15:15.539
Aah.

15:15.623 --> 15:17.291
- [boy 6] Whatever. Go.
- [boy 4] Keep going.

15:17.374 --> 15:19.209
- [groaning]
- [boy 4] You're killing me.

15:19.293 --> 15:21.795
- [boy 3] After? At lunch?
- [boy 4] No. My mom made…

15:21.879 --> 15:24.632
[coach] You're almost done.
Stay strong and keep running!

15:24.715 --> 15:25.841
[Yeong-bin] Look how he runs.

15:26.800 --> 15:28.010
[bully 1 chuckling]

15:28.093 --> 15:30.512
[bully 2] Fuck, man. He's like a zombie.

15:30.596 --> 15:32.056
- [moaning]
- [bully 1 laughing]

15:32.139 --> 15:34.058
[bully 2] He'd be faster
running like this.

15:34.141 --> 15:36.602
- [all laughing]
- [bully 1] Hey, I doubt that.

15:36.685 --> 15:40.981
[bully 2 snarling] I'm the world's fuckin'
fastest speed-walking zombie!

15:41.065 --> 15:42.900
[laughter]

15:46.862 --> 15:47.821
[bully 1] Shit.

15:51.992 --> 15:52.868
Get that.

15:56.664 --> 15:57.665
[bully 1] Keep cool.

15:58.874 --> 16:00.084
Don't let him get to you.

16:12.846 --> 16:14.223
What's your name again?

16:16.558 --> 16:18.018
I'm Lee Jeong-chan.

16:20.562 --> 16:21.522
Uh-huh.

16:24.566 --> 16:27.528
[bully 1 sighs]
Ahem. I'm glad you kept your cool.

16:30.572 --> 16:32.366
[panting]

16:32.449 --> 16:33.492
[stopwatch bleeps]

16:33.575 --> 16:34.868
Nine minutes and 48.

16:34.952 --> 16:37.204
- [sighs]
- [coach] Yeon Si-eun.

16:38.330 --> 16:41.125
- Put more effort into getting fit, okay?
- [coughing]

16:41.208 --> 16:43.585
[coach] The healthier you are,
the more you can study.

16:43.669 --> 16:45.045
[panting]

16:45.963 --> 16:48.173
[coach] One of you
take him to the nurse's office.

16:49.216 --> 16:51.301
No need. I'm totally fine.

16:52.886 --> 16:53.929
I'm okay.

16:55.973 --> 16:56.849
[bully 2] "I'm okay."

16:57.641 --> 16:59.768
"Uh… uh, uh… I'm okay."

16:59.852 --> 17:02.521
He was so full of bullshit, man.
He was coughing up a lung.

17:02.604 --> 17:03.480
Yeong-bin-a.

17:03.564 --> 17:06.775
- We need a day when we can beat his ass.
- [bully 2] Yeah. You remember his eyes?

17:06.859 --> 17:08.610
- "Next time, be careful."
- [bully 1] Agreed.

17:08.694 --> 17:11.947
"Be careful not to make more mistakes."
I wanna gouge his fucking eyes out.

17:12.031 --> 17:13.907
- [laughing]
- Hey. Gimme some of that.

17:18.704 --> 17:20.289
[suspenseful music playing]

17:20.998 --> 17:23.292
[bully 2] Ugh, what the hell's that smell?

17:23.375 --> 17:26.253
[bully 1] Ugh, he smells like shit.
Oh. I'm gonna puke.

17:26.336 --> 17:27.379
[giggles]

17:28.005 --> 17:28.881
Stop it.

17:30.299 --> 17:31.341
Do me a favor.

17:33.260 --> 17:34.094
What?

17:34.678 --> 17:36.096
You better leave me alone.

17:36.180 --> 17:37.431
[bully 1 laughs]

17:37.514 --> 17:39.141
[tense music playing]

17:51.195 --> 17:53.238
What are you mumbling about now?

17:56.408 --> 17:57.409
I was clear.

18:05.876 --> 18:07.127
[choking]

18:08.170 --> 18:09.421
[bully 1] Oh, see?

18:09.505 --> 18:12.049
He's just actin' tough. But he's nothing.

18:12.132 --> 18:14.051
[chokes] Let go.

18:14.134 --> 18:15.219
[bully 2] Next time,

18:15.886 --> 18:18.055
be polite when you ask for favors.

18:21.517 --> 18:23.560
Try it again. Properly.

18:25.187 --> 18:26.605
Let go of me.

18:28.357 --> 18:30.025
- Don't.
- Should I say anything?

18:30.609 --> 18:32.402
- Someone should say something.
- Hey, Yeong-bin.

18:32.486 --> 18:33.612
Keep holding.

18:34.696 --> 18:36.073
Let go and I'll kill you.

18:40.953 --> 18:42.079
[man] Hey!

18:42.162 --> 18:43.413
- What's goin' on?
- [coughing]

18:43.497 --> 18:46.667
Ah, yeah, it's not what it looks like.
We were just messing around.

18:47.167 --> 18:48.043
You okay, Si-eun?

18:52.589 --> 18:53.674
- Han Tae-hun.
- [bully 1] Yes?

18:53.757 --> 18:54.758
Well?

18:55.259 --> 18:57.845
- Hey. Don't make us get demerits.
- [Tae-hun] We were joking around.

18:59.263 --> 19:00.472
Think of college.

19:01.014 --> 19:01.890
[sighs]

19:02.516 --> 19:04.393
[man] Yeon Si-eun, you tell me.

19:05.352 --> 19:06.728
Were you joking around?

19:09.731 --> 19:12.151
Yes. We were messing around.

19:12.234 --> 19:14.361
[man] Don't let me
catch you boys again, okay?

19:14.444 --> 19:15.320
[Tae-hun] Yes, sir.

19:22.411 --> 19:23.829
[gentle ambient music playing]

19:23.912 --> 19:25.539
[boy 1] Wait up. Wait up!

19:28.041 --> 19:30.127
It's not like
we're gonna be late. Come on.

19:32.087 --> 19:33.213
[boy 2] Nice.

19:33.297 --> 19:35.465
[boy 1 sighs] No!

19:36.675 --> 19:38.510
[bleeps]

19:49.521 --> 19:51.732
[woman on video] What are
these merchants called? Gongin.

19:51.815 --> 19:53.734
Gongin is also an important concept.

19:53.817 --> 19:56.278
- If Uniform Land Tax Law is in the text…
- [doorbell chimes]

19:56.361 --> 20:00.782
…you can look for the word gongin in
choices one, two, three, four, and five.

20:00.866 --> 20:02.367
- This also works in reverse.
- [chiming]

20:02.451 --> 20:05.537
When you see the word gongin,
look for the Uniform Land Tax Law.

20:05.621 --> 20:08.457
After this, we'll see the implementation
of sangpyeong tong--

20:08.540 --> 20:10.000
- [pauses video]
- [banging at door]

20:11.710 --> 20:13.962
- [banging]
- Who's there?

20:15.088 --> 20:16.089
[Su-ho] Delivery.

20:17.716 --> 20:19.051
I didn't order anything.

20:19.134 --> 20:21.553
[Su-ho] What? No, I got the right place.

20:26.642 --> 20:27.809
[lock bleeps]

20:29.895 --> 20:31.563
What? It's the nerd.

20:32.189 --> 20:33.315
Why are you here?

20:36.318 --> 20:37.486
I didn't order that.

20:37.569 --> 20:38.403
Huh?

20:39.154 --> 20:41.573
Dongbaek Apartment, block 102, unit 902?

20:43.909 --> 20:44.785
It's 101.

20:47.037 --> 20:48.288
[Su-ho] It says 102.

20:50.374 --> 20:51.708
[quirky music plays]

20:52.376 --> 20:54.211
Dang it. Guess you're right

20:54.294 --> 20:55.212
Ahem.

20:57.381 --> 20:58.715
Hey, bro. Cup of water?

21:00.717 --> 21:02.261
- Why should I?
- We're in the same class.

21:02.344 --> 21:04.930
- We're friends. You're being kind of rude.
- [Si-eun] Hey--

21:05.013 --> 21:08.183
[Su-ho] Don't be so cheap.
I'm just asking for water. Right?

21:08.767 --> 21:10.227
- Ugh!
- [lock bleeps]

21:10.310 --> 21:11.603
[Su-ho groans and sighs]

21:12.229 --> 21:15.524
If I get dehydrated and faint,
you wanna be responsible for that?

21:15.607 --> 21:18.652
[sighs] Don't be so mean.
I just asked for water.

21:19.278 --> 21:22.698
But you're just standing there.
I guess I'm gonna faint and die now.

21:23.448 --> 21:26.201
[groans] I'm even losing my voice.

21:37.087 --> 21:38.088
Aah.

21:39.089 --> 21:40.382
[groans]

21:41.091 --> 21:43.218
- Aah!
- Who's the one being rude?

21:45.053 --> 21:45.929
[Su-ho groans]

21:46.555 --> 21:50.058
[sighs] Thanks, man.
I'll buy you three waters tomorrow.

21:51.560 --> 21:54.354
Keep studying hard, hmm? See you later.

21:57.274 --> 21:58.608
And listen to your mom.

21:59.901 --> 22:01.069
Am I doing this right?

22:06.033 --> 22:07.117
[lock whirs]

22:07.951 --> 22:09.202
[lock bleeps]

22:17.210 --> 22:18.962
[teacher] We have a new student.

22:19.046 --> 22:20.255
Please introduce yourself.

22:24.801 --> 22:26.720
Yes. Hello.

22:26.803 --> 22:29.306
Ahem. I'm Oh Beom-seok, yeah.

22:29.973 --> 22:31.350
[Tae-hun] Yeah!

22:31.433 --> 22:32.768
Whoo!

22:33.685 --> 22:35.020
Okay.

22:35.103 --> 22:36.980
Everyone, be nice to Beom-seok.

22:37.064 --> 22:39.066
[musical chiming]

22:44.946 --> 22:45.864
[Tae-hun laughing]

22:45.947 --> 22:47.824
- [Yeong-bin] Check him out.
- [Tae-hun] Should we?

22:48.325 --> 22:50.660
- [bully] Let's go.
- [Tae-hun] Ah! Ahem.

22:53.955 --> 22:55.832
- [bully] Hi.
- [Tae-hun] Ahem.

22:57.667 --> 22:58.960
[Yeong-bin] Oh Beom-seok?

22:59.503 --> 23:01.797
- Yes.
- [Yeong-bin] Where did you transfer from?

23:02.881 --> 23:06.593
- I transferred from Mungang High School.
- [all chuckling] Ooh!

23:06.676 --> 23:08.387
[bully] Dude's got some money.

23:10.555 --> 23:12.015
So you must know Ji-won?

23:12.099 --> 23:13.600
I'm best friends with him.

23:15.644 --> 23:17.521
[Beom-seok] No, I don't know him.

23:18.397 --> 23:19.564
You don't know Ji-won?

23:20.649 --> 23:21.942
You don't know Han Ji-won?

23:23.693 --> 23:27.697
Um, I think I've heard of him,
but I really don't know him at all.

23:28.740 --> 23:29.616
[scoffs]

23:29.699 --> 23:30.867
[tense music playing]

23:37.582 --> 23:39.584
[knuckles cracking]

23:41.420 --> 23:42.421
Move it.

23:45.215 --> 23:46.258
That's my seat.

23:48.677 --> 23:49.719
No thanks.

23:58.728 --> 23:59.896
I said move.

24:03.400 --> 24:04.985
[sighs] I am sick of your shit.

24:07.028 --> 24:08.071
[bully] Not now.

24:14.161 --> 24:15.829
[clicks loudly]

24:15.912 --> 24:18.540
[Su-ho] Why have you all been
so chatty lately?

24:18.623 --> 24:20.750
You won't even let your hyeong sleep.

24:21.710 --> 24:22.961
Can I go back to sleep?

24:24.045 --> 24:24.963
Hmm?

24:28.300 --> 24:29.301
Watch yourself.

24:35.724 --> 24:37.184
[Su-ho groans]

24:37.267 --> 24:38.768
[chair scrapes]

24:51.615 --> 24:52.491
[techno music playing]

24:52.574 --> 24:54.451
- [bully 1] Everybody get one?
- [girl 1] Hurry up!

24:54.534 --> 24:56.411
- [Tae-hun] Let's get drunk!
- [boy 1] Let's go!

24:56.495 --> 24:58.371
[all] Wasted!

24:58.455 --> 25:00.290
- [cheering and laughing]
- [Tae-hun] Yeah!

25:01.082 --> 25:02.834
[boy 1] Yeong-bin,
you're really not drinking?

25:02.918 --> 25:04.753
Again? Why do you keep backing out?

25:04.836 --> 25:07.547
Next week is the mock test,
you fucking idiots.

25:07.631 --> 25:08.882
- [groans]
- [giggles]

25:08.965 --> 25:11.927
[boy 2] Study hard and get
a killer job at a huge corporation.

25:12.010 --> 25:14.137
[laughter]

25:14.221 --> 25:15.222
Yeong-bin-a.

25:15.305 --> 25:19.017
Yeon Si-eun's lost his fuckin' mind
lately, right? He's mouthing off.

25:19.100 --> 25:21.561
What the hell is he gonna do with a pen?
Dumbass.

25:21.645 --> 25:23.897
I mean, even today
when that asshole glared at us,

25:23.980 --> 25:25.524
his eyes looked fucking crazy.

25:25.607 --> 25:28.443
- Almost killed him in front of everyone.
- [bully] Bullshit.

25:28.527 --> 25:30.779
- You were standing still.
- [Tae-hun] Bullshit, you asshole.

25:30.862 --> 25:32.155
I almost snapped his neck.

25:32.239 --> 25:34.324
What do you think
I should do with that guy?

25:34.950 --> 25:37.244
I keep messing with him,
but nothing's working.

25:38.328 --> 25:41.581
That fucking shithead's soul
just won't break. At all.

25:41.665 --> 25:43.667
[boy 3 in background]
Seriously, man? I told you…

25:44.167 --> 25:45.335
Okay. All right, that's fine.

25:45.919 --> 25:46.878
College?

25:46.962 --> 25:48.129
[boy 4 in background] Come on…

25:48.964 --> 25:51.258
Studying is the only thing
he ever cares about.

25:51.341 --> 25:55.262
We'd probably destroy his soul
if we messed with that. It's all he does.

25:55.345 --> 25:58.014
[Tae-hun] What the hell are you saying?
Say it so I can understand.

25:58.098 --> 26:00.225
[bully 1] Your dumb ass
wouldn't understand anyway.

26:00.934 --> 26:03.395
Tell me,
how do you think the narrator feels?

26:03.478 --> 26:05.689
- [papers rustling]
- [teacher 4] Well? Thoughts?

26:07.440 --> 26:08.733
It's anxiousness.

26:11.319 --> 26:12.320
Anxious.

26:14.030 --> 26:16.366
"Even a rustling leaf comes to me."

26:16.449 --> 26:18.451
[electronic music playing]

26:22.330 --> 26:24.040
[cheering]

26:24.124 --> 26:26.668
- [bully] Fine. Real.
- [Tae-hun] Here's another one.

26:26.751 --> 26:29.588
- [bully 1] Which one?
- [Yeong-bin] Not gonna let it slide.

26:29.671 --> 26:31.423
- Hey, hyeong. You're here.
- [Tae-hun] Welcome.

26:31.506 --> 26:33.174
- [girl 1] Hi!
- [girl 2] Hi!

26:33.258 --> 26:35.302
- [all] Whoo!
- [girl 2] He really brought it!

26:35.385 --> 26:37.304
- [girl 1] Awesome!
- That's from Cheonan.

26:37.387 --> 26:40.056
- The trip cost more.
- [bully] I've been waiting for this!

26:40.140 --> 26:42.809
[Yeong-bin] Hey, Hui-ju-ya,
pay your share. You're the last one.

26:42.892 --> 26:44.894
- [bully 2] Good party.
- [Yeong-bin] Pay for his trip.

26:44.978 --> 26:46.563
- [Hui-ju] 100,000?
- [bully 1] This yours?

26:46.646 --> 26:49.065
- [Yeong-bin] Oh, yeah, thanks.
- [Hui-ju] Keep the rest.

26:49.733 --> 26:51.359
- [Yeong-bin] Here.
- [Hui-ju giggles]

26:54.529 --> 26:55.614
[Yeong-bin] Hyeong.

26:56.114 --> 26:56.990
Count it.

26:59.159 --> 27:00.076
I trust you.

27:01.828 --> 27:03.705
[Yeong-bin] Hyeong. Wait up.

27:03.788 --> 27:06.082
- I wanna ask something.
- [bully] We stocked up!

27:06.166 --> 27:08.251
[boy 3] Hey, Yeong-bin.
Where are you going?

27:08.335 --> 27:09.544
[Yeong-bin] My tutor is coming.

27:09.628 --> 27:11.755
- You gonna use those?
- [boy 1] Just go.

27:13.006 --> 27:14.382
- [Yeong-bin] Have fun.
- Thanks, man.

27:14.466 --> 27:16.468
- [boy 1] You're leaving?
- [bully 2] Thank you!

27:16.551 --> 27:17.552
- See ya!
- Where you going?

27:17.636 --> 27:19.012
- [Hui-ju] Let him go.
- [girl 1] Why?

27:19.095 --> 27:20.805
- [boy 2] Be safe.
- [Hui-ju] You don't know?

27:20.889 --> 27:22.349
- Ugh!
- That guy's always leaving.

27:22.432 --> 27:23.725
[Hui-ju] That's how he is.

27:26.853 --> 27:28.563
[echoing clang]

27:28.647 --> 27:30.649
[sounds muffled]

27:31.566 --> 27:33.568
[intense electronic music playing]

27:45.747 --> 27:47.499
[exhaling]

27:50.377 --> 27:51.670
[lighter clicks]

27:59.886 --> 28:01.638
[coughing]

28:07.686 --> 28:09.062
[sounds return to normal]

28:09.145 --> 28:10.939
[techno music playing]

28:12.732 --> 28:13.650
Hyeong.

28:17.904 --> 28:19.906
Your mom came to our place the other day.

28:19.989 --> 28:21.533
She said you haven't been home.

28:22.575 --> 28:23.785
[dealer] Get to the point.

28:25.745 --> 28:26.746
It's not that.

28:28.039 --> 28:29.249
It's about the fentanyl.

28:30.583 --> 28:33.795
What happens if you just stick it on
somewhere on your neck?

28:36.339 --> 28:38.091
You won't feel it as strong.

28:38.925 --> 28:41.010
It's a painkiller, so you'll zone out.

28:42.762 --> 28:44.347
You'll get sluggish and sleepy.

28:44.931 --> 28:46.474
Some people might throw up.

28:47.726 --> 28:48.977
- Why?
- Huh?

28:50.019 --> 28:52.355
Nothing. I was just curious.

28:55.859 --> 28:57.902
- [dealer] Yeong-bin-a.
- [Yeong-bin] Hmm?

28:58.945 --> 29:00.613
Don't screw around too much.

29:02.532 --> 29:04.617
You have nothing to worry about
with me, hyeong.

29:10.123 --> 29:11.040
Bye.

29:14.669 --> 29:16.713
That cheap-ass motherfucker.

29:19.591 --> 29:20.675
[sighs]

29:25.764 --> 29:26.848
[phone bleeps]

29:27.348 --> 29:28.683
[ringing tone]

29:29.976 --> 29:32.729
- [call answered]
- Hey, Ji-won. How have you been?

29:33.521 --> 29:35.523
[gentle pop music playing]

29:38.026 --> 29:39.986
- [phone buzzes]
- [woman on radio] Standard 92.9 FM…

29:40.069 --> 29:41.696
FATHER:
EVERYTHING OKAY?

29:41.780 --> 29:43.406
Your broadcasting station, JPS,

29:43.490 --> 29:46.743
would like to announce that
the time is now 11 p.m. HLQA.

29:48.787 --> 29:49.829
YES

29:49.913 --> 29:51.664
Why don't you reach out to your loved ones

29:51.748 --> 29:54.667
and let them know
that they have done a great job today?

29:55.543 --> 29:56.419
Then we all can--

30:06.638 --> 30:07.931
Wait a minute.

30:09.808 --> 30:12.393
[sighs] We usually only do dead drops.

30:13.144 --> 30:14.771
Next time, we won't meet.

30:18.858 --> 30:19.692
Here.

30:19.776 --> 30:21.110
FENTANYL PATCH

30:22.111 --> 30:24.113
[dealer] Hey. I said a girl.

30:28.451 --> 30:30.829
[man 1] Shit. We almost got screwed.

30:32.747 --> 30:33.748
Move.

30:35.708 --> 30:36.835
- [man 1 laughs]
- What?

30:38.586 --> 30:40.922
You heard. You're in my way.

30:41.506 --> 30:43.383
Well, fuck, man. Maybe you're in my way.

30:43.967 --> 30:44.926
You wanna die?

30:46.094 --> 30:49.264
I don't like the way you're looking at me,
you little asshole.

30:51.850 --> 30:53.017
[clicks]

30:54.477 --> 30:55.311
[man 2] Hey.

30:56.396 --> 30:58.106
Stop staring.

30:58.690 --> 30:59.732
[sighs]

31:00.358 --> 31:04.153
[man 2] You better look away from me
before I break your skull open, fucker.

31:06.739 --> 31:07.657
Hey, hyeong.

31:09.075 --> 31:10.034
[dealer] Go ahead.

31:18.918 --> 31:20.336
Watch who you mess with.

31:21.004 --> 31:22.505
You almost got stabbed.

31:24.841 --> 31:26.050
MOCK TEST IN ONE DAY

31:26.134 --> 31:27.635
[papers rustling]

31:38.771 --> 31:39.814
[door opens]

31:39.898 --> 31:41.441
[Tae-hun] Hey, what's up?

31:49.824 --> 31:52.035
Hey, Beom-seok. The teacher wants you.

31:53.953 --> 31:56.456
- Huh?
- [Yeong-bin] Our teacher wants to see you.

32:14.682 --> 32:15.558
Here.

32:17.894 --> 32:18.853
Thanks, man.

32:21.481 --> 32:22.607
[can opens]

32:28.696 --> 32:29.822
[Yeong-bin] Oh, right.

32:30.490 --> 32:32.492
I heard you had a tough time at Mungang.

32:34.077 --> 32:35.954
[tense music playing]

32:37.372 --> 32:39.082
I talked with Ji-won yesterday.

32:41.167 --> 32:42.085
Huh?

32:43.294 --> 32:45.880
I heard you got your ass kicked
almost every day.

32:46.631 --> 32:48.257
- [grunts]
- [boy] Good one!

32:50.551 --> 32:53.805
[Yeong-bin] Is that why you transferred?
Like a loser?

32:58.935 --> 33:00.478
[chuckles] I mean,

33:01.521 --> 33:03.523
I won't do anything like that to you.

33:04.399 --> 33:05.817
I wanna be your friend.

33:09.028 --> 33:10.196
Sit down.

33:12.907 --> 33:13.866
Okay.

33:21.290 --> 33:22.583
[Yeong-bin] Are you grateful?

33:26.212 --> 33:29.007
I'm going to be your friend,
and I'm gonna keep your secret.

33:32.051 --> 33:33.302
Yeah, thank you.

33:33.928 --> 33:34.887
Thanks, man.

33:35.763 --> 33:37.181
[Yeong-bin] If you're grateful,

33:38.224 --> 33:39.517
do me a favor.

33:45.523 --> 33:46.691
What is it?

33:49.485 --> 33:50.486
[Yeong-bin] Take it.

33:54.991 --> 33:56.409
[papers rustling]

33:57.910 --> 34:00.955
[teacher 2] You know the language section
takes more time, right?

34:01.039 --> 34:02.331
- [students] Yes, ma'am.
- Yes.

34:02.415 --> 34:03.708
[teacher 2] Use your time wisely.

34:04.250 --> 34:05.501
[students] Yes.

34:06.127 --> 34:07.420
[teacher 2] And don't cheat.

34:07.920 --> 34:09.172
[students] Okay.

34:09.672 --> 34:10.757
[Tae-hun] All right!

34:16.679 --> 34:17.847
[clattering]

34:26.856 --> 34:28.608
[tense music playing]

34:49.545 --> 34:51.005
[clock ticking]

34:51.089 --> 34:52.131
[sighs]

34:59.305 --> 35:01.641
There was a bug that landed on your neck.

35:03.476 --> 35:05.812
Boys, what's going on?

35:06.562 --> 35:07.897
Face the front.

35:23.538 --> 35:25.414
[dealer] You won't feel it as strong.

35:25.498 --> 35:27.625
It's a painkiller, so you'll zone out.

35:28.292 --> 35:29.794
You'll get sluggish and sleepy.

35:30.419 --> 35:31.921
Some people might throw up.

35:33.089 --> 35:34.715
[tense music playing]

35:41.806 --> 35:43.224
[Si-eun] In literary expression,

35:43.307 --> 35:45.643
there's a method of representing
the object of expression

35:45.726 --> 35:47.979
by replacing it
with other related ideas or objects.

35:48.062 --> 35:51.482
This includes replacing the substance
with properties of the object

35:51.566 --> 35:53.484
or replacing the whole
with a part of the subject.

35:54.277 --> 35:56.904
These methods can be interchanged
with one another…

36:06.873 --> 36:09.292
[teacher] Hey, where are you going?

36:15.882 --> 36:17.425
[music intensifying]

36:18.259 --> 36:19.510
[panting]

36:23.931 --> 36:26.017
[crashing]

36:29.103 --> 36:30.521
[water running]

36:30.605 --> 36:32.273
[gasping]

36:45.077 --> 36:46.370
[music quietens]

36:46.454 --> 36:48.122
[clock ticking]

37:22.281 --> 37:23.115
[boy 1] What?

37:24.867 --> 37:25.826
[slap]

37:28.496 --> 37:29.497
[slap]

37:30.456 --> 37:31.332
Oh…

37:32.166 --> 37:34.043
Why are you doing that? What's wrong?

37:48.224 --> 37:50.726
Hey, what is going on with you?

37:54.772 --> 37:56.899
Oh. Nothing.

38:00.528 --> 38:02.530
- [Tae-hun] I can't believe I got none.
- [boy 1] Two.

38:02.613 --> 38:03.656
- [boy 2] Yes!
- [boy 1] Five.

38:03.739 --> 38:05.783
- [boy 3] How many did you get wrong?
- [boy 4] What?

38:05.866 --> 38:08.035
- Three?
- [boy 1] Integrated social studies.

38:08.536 --> 38:10.079
[all exclaiming and laughing]

38:10.162 --> 38:13.165
- [boy 3] I didn't put four on any.
- [boy 4] I'm gonna crush this!

38:13.249 --> 38:14.417
- [boy 1] One.
- [boy 6] What?

38:14.500 --> 38:16.377
- [boy 1] One.
- [boy 4] No, it wasn't!

38:16.460 --> 38:18.713
- [boy 1] Five. Four.
- [boy 4] Seriously, that's a mistake.

38:18.796 --> 38:21.257
- [boy 1] Five. Five.
- [boy 5] Shut up.

38:22.091 --> 38:23.801
- [boy 1] Three.
- [boy 6] Yes!

38:23.884 --> 38:25.594
- [boy 1] Two.
- [boy 5] How many did you get?

38:25.678 --> 38:26.846
- [boy 4] Three?
- [boy 1] Five.

38:26.929 --> 38:29.015
- [boy 4] I only got one right.
- [boy 5] Dude, too fast.

38:29.098 --> 38:30.057
[boy 1] Four.

38:30.641 --> 38:31.559
Three.

38:32.560 --> 38:34.312
- One.
- [boy 6] They're the ones that put the--

38:34.395 --> 38:36.147
- [boy 1] Four.
- [boy 6] I can't hear him.

38:36.230 --> 38:38.983
I like when it's all B's.
Just write B every time.

38:39.066 --> 38:40.192
[boy 4] Okay.

38:41.152 --> 38:42.945
[silence]

38:45.197 --> 38:46.449
[Tae-hun] What?

38:46.532 --> 38:48.367
- What's going on?
- What?

38:48.951 --> 38:49.869
Quiet.

38:54.123 --> 38:56.125
[tense music playing]

39:02.089 --> 39:03.424
[Beom-seok] Si-eun, uh,

39:04.425 --> 39:06.010
it's… it's not what you think.

39:07.011 --> 39:08.137
[creaking]

39:27.239 --> 39:28.866
[scribbling]

39:28.949 --> 39:30.326
[Si-eun] Newton's second law.

39:30.409 --> 39:32.661
Force is equal to mass times acceleration.

39:33.913 --> 39:35.414
[scribbling]

39:35.498 --> 39:37.458
[Si-eun] The centrifugal force
of an object

39:37.541 --> 39:39.627
can be used to create a greater impact.

39:40.878 --> 39:42.129
- [Yeong-bin] Ah!
- [all gasping]

39:42.213 --> 39:43.297
[wails]

39:45.841 --> 39:47.301
- Oh my God.
- [Tae-hun yelping]

39:47.385 --> 39:49.470
You fucking lunatic!

39:49.553 --> 39:50.846
[Yeong-bin grunting]

39:53.182 --> 39:54.392
[Yeong-bin groans]

39:56.602 --> 39:57.812
[muffled] Wait! Wait!

39:58.771 --> 40:00.314
[yelping]

40:10.491 --> 40:11.992
[moaning]

40:25.548 --> 40:26.882
[boy] That's like…

40:33.431 --> 40:34.890
I asked a favor.

40:36.934 --> 40:38.144
I said to stop.

40:47.653 --> 40:49.780
- [students exclaiming]
- Oh…

40:51.282 --> 40:53.826
Let's not cross the line, hmm?
Enough is enough.

40:56.287 --> 40:57.496
[boy] That was the line?

40:58.414 --> 40:59.248
You next?

40:59.331 --> 41:02.710
Me? Nah,
you just woke up a guardian angel.

41:05.045 --> 41:06.005
[chuckles]

41:08.132 --> 41:09.049
Funny?

41:11.510 --> 41:12.595
Trying to be.

41:18.434 --> 41:19.643
[all exclaiming]

41:26.150 --> 41:28.152
["Brass Knuckle" by Boi B playing]

41:32.656 --> 41:33.908
♪ Yeah, uh-uh ♪

41:38.162 --> 41:38.996
♪ Word ♪

41:39.079 --> 41:40.998
♪ Brass knuckle, do the damn thing ♪

41:41.957 --> 41:43.501
♪ Um, um… ♪

41:44.919 --> 41:46.921
[lyrics in Korean]

41:58.641 --> 41:59.600
♪ You never know… ♪

41:59.683 --> 42:01.685
[lyrics in Korean]

42:25.501 --> 42:27.920
♪ Pow, brass knuckle, do the damn thing ♪

42:28.003 --> 42:30.381
♪ Pow, brass knuckle, do the damn thing ♪

42:30.464 --> 42:33.133
♪ Pow, brass knuckle, do the damn thing… ♪

42:33.217 --> 42:35.219
[lyrics in Korean]

42:35.302 --> 42:37.805
♪ Pow, brass knuckle, do the damn thing ♪

42:37.888 --> 42:40.224
♪ Pow, brass knuckle, do the damn thing ♪

42:40.307 --> 42:42.768
♪ Pow, brass knuckle, do the damn thing ♪

42:42.851 --> 42:45.145
♪ Good boy gone bad… ♪

42:45.229 --> 42:47.231
[lyrics in Korean]

42:48.524 --> 42:50.192
♪ But I got K2 in my mouth… ♪

42:50.276 --> 42:52.278
[lyrics in Korean]

42:57.032 --> 42:58.117
♪ Break your fucking neck… ♪

42:58.200 --> 43:00.119
[lyrics in Korean]

43:04.456 --> 43:05.583
♪ Smells like teen spirit… ♪

43:05.666 --> 43:07.668
[lyrics in Korean]

43:15.009 --> 43:15.884
♪ Brass knuckle… ♪

43:15.968 --> 43:17.970
[lyrics in Korean]

43:23.601 --> 43:24.852
♪ But you don't hear me though ♪

43:24.935 --> 43:27.187
♪ Pow, brass knuckle, do the damn thing ♪

43:27.271 --> 43:29.732
♪ Pow, brass knuckle, do the damn thing ♪

43:29.815 --> 43:32.443
♪ Pow, brass knuckle, do the damn thing… ♪

43:32.526 --> 43:34.653
[lyrics in Korean]

43:34.737 --> 43:37.156
♪ Pow, brass knuckle, do the damn thing ♪

43:37.239 --> 43:39.617
♪ Pow, brass knuckle, do the damn thing ♪

43:39.700 --> 43:42.119
♪ Pow, brass knuckle, do the damn thing ♪

43:42.202 --> 43:44.705
♪ Good boy gone bad ♪

43:55.299 --> 43:56.925
ALL NAMES, PLACES,
AND EVENTS ARE FICTIONAL

43:57.009 --> 43:58.594
ANY SIMILARITY TO REALITY IS COINCIDENTAL
